# ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# Root .gitignore for OpenHuman monorepo
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Rust ──
**/target/
**/*.rs.bk
# Lock files: openhuman-server ships a [[bin]], so keep its lock for
# reproducible builds. The Rust SDK is a library crate — its lock is noise.
sdks/rust/Cargo.lock

# ── Dart / Flutter ──
**/.dart_tool/
**/.flutter-plugins
**/.flutter-plugins-dependencies
**/.packages
**/.pub-cache/
**/.pub/
**/build/
**/.fvm/
**/coverage/

# ── TypeScript / Node ──
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/.turbo/
**/.parcel-cache/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

# ── Python ──
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/.venv/
**/venv/
**/.mypy_cache/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/*.egg-info/

# ── Environment ──
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# ── Editor / IDE ──
.idea/
*.iml
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# ── Build artifacts ──
*.log
tmp/

# ── Local agent workspace (session memory, not project source) ──
.workbuddy/

# ── Observation fixtures (request captures) ──
observations/

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════─
#  Kept locally, NOT published to the public repository
# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# These stay on disk for the maintainer but are deliberately untracked,
# so they never reach the public remote. Run `git rm --cached <path>`
# (not `rm`) if you need to exclude something else: deleting it would
# throw away work that is only *unpublishable*, not worthless.
#
# Untracked here because they are either operator-specific or
# superseded snapshots whose stale numbers would mislead a reader:
#
#   - OpenHuman_ARCHITECTURE_FINAL.md : early vision spec; its stack
#     section (Redis / NATS / OAuth2) no longer matches the code.
#   - docs/PHASE9_*.md, docs/PHASE10_*.md : point-in-time validation
#     reports with counts and claims that have since moved on.
#   - deploy/nginx/openhuman.conf : a live deployment config naming a
#     real domain and certificate paths. Use
#     deploy/nginx/openhuman.conf.template instead.
#   - .vscode/settings.json : editor-local, and references SDK dirs
#     that no longer exist.
OpenHuman_ARCHITECTURE_FINAL.md
docs/PHASE9_E2E_TEST_ENVIRONMENT.md
docs/PHASE9_E2E_VALIDATION_REPORT.md
docs/PHASE10_RELEASE_HARDENING_REPORT.md
deploy/nginx/openhuman.conf
.vscode/
